=7f20f&oh=00_Af82Z0Cnr5HF8RGXu4deqq3EMFc0b6bl5eqlam5oh-WiPQ&oe=6A46838D"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "4452217025106005", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_4452217031772671_8109728075645563125_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1aO_OnWGYcoQ7kNvwGeTWsy&_nc_oc=AdqugrM4uEiFs9qJ_q9-rjNMmzS1oNkNkxd64FB4tq9jxElOqIJNSVoYuqNfzU_9wQA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af85Y_NTDbG-kbwPEsPdPDnPjwKNyPC7NDUPH3tGwGmSdg&oe=6A467B8A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "CYBIONYX InMotion", "keywords": ["PC", "3D", "motion", "immersion", "desktop"], "long_description": "**Step inside your screen.**\n\nInMotion is an immersive new way to experience your favorite PC games and movies. Any flat PC game becomes somewhere you are, not something you watch. You're inside it, not looking in from the outside. Turn your head, and the whole world turns with you.\n\nFlat scenes stop looking flat. The foreground steps closer, the background falls away, and the picture's light spills past the edges into your view, so the world melts into your own. Movies come alive with the same depth: any video, not only the ones made for 3D.\n\nYour whole library works as it is, with no special VR games or mods. Play with your controllers or your keyboard and mouse, whatever feels right, and connect in moments over Wi-Fi or USB-C.\n\n## What you'll need\n\n- A **Windows PC** with the free InMotion desktop app. Grab it at inmotion.cybionyx.space\n- The headset app connects to your PC through it, so you'll want **both**\n- Connect over **Wi-Fi** or **USB-C**\n\n---\n\n*Early Access: we're improving it constantly, and your feedback shapes what comes next.*", "short_description": "CYBIONYX InMotion - play any PC-game with immersion"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://inmotion.cybionyx.space/legal/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://inmotion.cybi