&oe=6A4664BB"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot04.png", "id": "1535736538159864", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825415_1535736544826530_4016413559328759525_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mOGS8MK5NekQ7kNvwHYgjdj&_nc_oc=Adr15s5HCQhRAfjAN8vrMIxnXxe_0GN1wwErSWwxGgEeWD9IoRwDosRFffnfiYsdVzs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9iPXP3_R1TL4rTVVZDZ1m5eDTVfeC5b6ii25SCIkeQEg&oe=6A465B66"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot01.png", "id": "974993768735462", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_974993772068795_3116712420112064562_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1e33WctguVYQ7kNvwEwgSGB&_nc_oc=AdqEoalJDYcatfTqX2U1N2y7BiGqwH6Mn0BjYJUt2IwDOkJO00KhwppZXqBw40vltVE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8WgorG4aqVA4veZzwqBAb0AbA2aCNNA0Ag1YBpD2ES8Q&oe=6A467E87"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "CYBIONYX InMotion", "keywords": ["streaming", "PC", "stereoscopic", "3D", "motion"], "long_description": "CYBIONYX InMotion streams your computer to your headset as a huge virtual display. Then lets you control it by moving your head and using your controllers as a mouse and keyboard. Play any PC game, work on your desktop, or watch movies\n\n- Giant curved virtual screen. Adjust size, curvature, and position\n- Aim with your head. Head motion maps to your mouse for natural look-to-aim control\n- Full controller input. Sticks and buttons act as mouse & keyboard, with ready-made mapping presets and gyro aiming\n- Real-time stereoscopic 3D \u2014 flat games and video gain genuine depth\n- Local and private \u2014 streams over a USB-C cable or your own Wi-Fi. No internet, no cloud, low latency\n- Desktop audio included", "short_description": "CYBIONYX InMotion mirrors your PC to your Meta Quest"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://inmotion.cybionyx.space/legal/privacy", "developer_te